      divides grid into bar_side and ext_side; may omit one terminal-row cell [observed, rare]
    position: anywhere such that bar_side has 3-12 cols wide and ext_side has 2-14 cols wide
  bar_side:
    side: left or right of separator (all bars on same side)
    bar_side_len: 2-12 cols
  bars:
    per_active_row: 1-2 monochrome bars (contiguous same-color runs); if 2 they are adjacent (no gap between them)
    bar_length: 1 to bar_side_len pixels
    anchoring: rightmost-bar's inner edge abuts separator (gap=0) typically; gap of 1 to separator allowed [observed, rare]
